<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="h-full">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mi Semana - Asistente Personal</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primary: { 50: '#eff6ff', 100: '#dbeafe', 500: '#3b82f6', 600: '#2563eb', 700: '#1d4ed8' },
                        accent: { 50: '#fdf4ff', 500: '#d946ef', 600: '#c026d3' }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Inter Font -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 9999px; }
        .dark .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #475569; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="h-full bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 transition-colors duration-200 overflow-hidden flex flex-col">

    <!-- Onboarding Modal (Personalización Inicial) -->
    <div id="onboarding-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col max-h-[90vh]">
            <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-primary-500 text-white p-2.5 rounded-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-xl"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Configuración Inicial</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Personaliza tu asistente para adaptarlo a tu estilo de vida</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button onclick="skipOnboarding()" class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700">Omitir por ahora</button>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar flex-1 space-y-6" id="onboarding-steps">
                <!-- Step 1: Horarios y Sueño -->
                <div class="space-y-4" data-step="1">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i> 1. Horarios de Descanso y Sueño
                    </h3>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-medium mb-1">Hora habitual de acostarse</label>
                            <input type="time" id="onb-sleep-time" value="23:00" class="w-full p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-transparent text-sm">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-medium mb-1">Hora habitual de despertar</label>
                            <input type="time" id="onb-wake-time" value="07:00" class="w-full p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-transparent text-sm">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2: Compromisos Fijos -->
                <div class="space-y-4" data-step="2">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i> 2. Compromisos Fijos Principales
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">¿Qué actividad ocupa gran parte de tus días (estudio, trabajo)?</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <input type="text" id="onb-fixed-title" placeholder="Ej: Universidad / Oficina" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-transparent text-sm">
                        <select id="onb-fixed-category" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-transparent text-sm">
                            <option value="estudio">Estudio</option>
                            <option value="trabajo" selected>Trabajo</option>
                            <option value="entrenamiento">Entrenamiento</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3: Preferencias Alimentarias -->
                <div class="space-y-4" data-step="3">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i> 3. Preferencias y Salud Nutricional
                    </h3>
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-medium mb-1">Alergias o restricciones alimentarias</label>
                            <input type="text" id="onb-allergies" placeholder="Ej: Ninguna, lactosa, frutos secos..." class="w-full p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-transparent text-sm">
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 pt-2">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="onb-minor" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary-600 rounded border-slate-300 focus:ring-primary-500">
                            <label for="onb-minor" class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">¿Eres menor de edad? (Priorizaremos variedad y energía sin restricciones calóricas)</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500" id="onb-step-indicator">Paso 1 de 3</span>
                <div class="space-x-3">
                    <button onclick="prevOnboardingStep()" id="onb-prev-btn" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 hidden">Anterior</button>
                    <button onclick="nextOnboardingStep()" id="onb-next-btn" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium bg-primary-600 text-white hover:bg-primary-700 shadow-sm transition-all">Siguiente</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Custom Toast Notification Container -->
    <div id="toast-container" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 flex flex-col space-y-2 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Main App Layout -->
    <div class="flex h-full w-full overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Sidebar Navigation (Desktop) -->
        <aside class="hidden md:flex flex-col w-64 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 z-20">
            <div class="p-5 flex items-center space-x-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary-600 to-accent-600 text-white p-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-md">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-bold text-lg leading-tight">Mi Semana</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Asistente Personal</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <nav class="flex-1 p-4 space-y-1.5 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
                <button onclick="switchTab('inicio')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 bg-primary-50 dark:bg-primary-950/50" data-tab="inicio">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Inicio</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('semana')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/50" data-tab="semana">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Mi Semana</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('comidas')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/50" data-tab="comidas">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Comidas & Menú</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('habitos')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/50" data-tab="habitos">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Hábitos & Agua</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('estadisticas')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/50" data-tab="estadisticas">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Estadísticas & Tiempo</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('configuracion')" class="nav-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/50" data-tab="configuracion">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gear w-5 text-center"></i> <span>Configuración</span>
                </button>
            </nav>

            <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700/50 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-emerald-500"></i>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium">Modo Local Seguro</span>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" class="p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-moon dark:fa-sun text-slate-600 dark:text-amber-400"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content Area -->
        <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden relative">
            
            <!-- Mobile Header -->
            <header class="md:hidden bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-4 flex justify-between items-center z-10">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary-600 to-accent-600 text-white p-2 rounded-lg shadow">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="font-bold text-base" id="mobile-title">Inicio</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-amber-400">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-moon dark:fa-sun"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="openActivityModal()" class="bg-primary-600 text-white p-2 rounded-lg shadow">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </header>

            <!-- Content Scroll Area -->
            <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 pb-24 md:pb-8" id="main-scroll-container">
                
                <!-- ================= TAB: INICIO ================= -->
                <div id="tab-inicio" class="tab-content space-y-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                    <!-- Welcome & Quick Status Banner -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 to-accent-600 rounded-3xl p-6 text-white shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <span class="bg-white/20 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Asistente Activo</span>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mt-2" id="welcome-greeting">¡Hola! Que tengas una gran semana</h2>
                            <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mt-1" id="current-date-display">Jueves, 15 de Octubre de 2026</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 w-full md:w-auto">
                            <button onclick="openActivityModal()" class="bg-white text-primary-600 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm shadow hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Nueva Actividad
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="switchTab('comidas')" class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur border border-white/20 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-white/20 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i> Ver Menú
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dashboard Grid -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <!-- Left 2 Cols: Next Activity & Today Agenda -->
                        <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6">
                            <!-- Next Activity Card -->
                            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-500"></i> Próxima Actividad
                                    </h3>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 font-medium cursor-pointer hover:underline" onclick="switchTab('semana')">Ver calendario completo</span>
                                </div>
                                <div id="next-activity-card" class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-700/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-600/60 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/50 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <div>
                                            <h4 class="font-bold text-base" id="next-act-title">Sesión de Estudio</h4>
                                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5"><span id="next-act-time">16:00 - 18:00</span> • <span id="next-act-category">Estudio</span></p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <button onclick="completeNextActivity()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold shadow transition-all">
                                        Completar
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Today Agenda summary -->
                            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-primary-500"></i> Agenda del Día
                                    </h3>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" id="today-count-badge">4 actividades</span>
                                </div>
                                <div id="today-activities-list" class="space-y-3">
                                    <!-- Injected via JS -->
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Col: Hydration, Meals & Quick Reminders -->
                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <!-- Water Quick Card -->
                            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet text-sky-500"></i> Hidratación Diaria
                                    </h3>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500" id="water-stat-text">1.5L / 2.5L</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 mb-4">
                                    <div class="relative flex-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-4 overflow-hidden">
                                        <div id="water-progress-bar" class="bg-sky-500 h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 60%"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-sm font-bold text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400" id="water-percent">60%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                                    <button onclick="addWater(250)" class="py-2 px-3 bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 rounded-xl font-medium text-xs hover:bg-sky-100 transition-colors border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-glass-water"></i> +250 ml
                                    </button>
                                    <button onclick="addWater(500)" class="py-2 px-3 bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 rounded-xl font-medium text-xs hover:bg-sky-100 transition-colors border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water"></i> +500 ml
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Today Meals Card -->
                            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils text-emerald-500"></i> Comidas de Hoy
                                    </h3>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-primary-600 cursor-pointer hover:underline" onclick="switchTab('comidas')">Editar menú</span>
                                </div>
                                <div id="today-meals-preview" class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
                                    <!-- Injected via JS -->
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ================= TAB: MI SEMANA (CALENDARIO) ================= -->
                <div id="tab-semana" class="tab-content space-y-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto hidden">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Calendario Semanal</h2>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Organiza tus compromisos, descansos y traslados sin superposiciones</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="flex bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 p-1 rounded-xl">
                                <button onclick="setCalendarView('semana')" id="btn-view-semana" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-600 shadow-sm transition-all">Semana</button>
                                <button onclick="setCalendarView('dia')" id="btn-view-dia" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition-all">Día</button>
                            </div>
                            <button onclick="openActivityModal()" class="bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold shadow transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Agregar Actividad
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Week Grid Container -->
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-7 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-700" id="calendar-grid">
                            <!-- Injected via JS -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ================= TAB: COMIDAS ================= -->
                <div id="tab-comidas" class="tab-content space-y-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto hidden">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Organización de Comidas & Menú</h2>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Menús equilibrados, recetas sencillas y lista de compras automática</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button onclick="generateShoppingList()" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold shadow transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i> Generar Lista de Compras
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Meals Tabs / Sections -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <!-- Left 2 Cols: Weekly Menu Grid -->
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-week text-primary-500"></i> Menú Semanal Planificado
                            </h3>
                            <div id="weekly-menu-container" class="space-y-3">
                                <!-- Injected via JS -->
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Col: Shopping List & Nutritional Note -->
                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <!-- Shopping List Card -->
                            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping text-emerald-500"></i> Lista de Compras
                                    </h3>
                                    <button onclick="clearShoppingList()" class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500">Limpiar</button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="shopping-list-container" class="space-y-2 text-sm max-h-80 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar pr-1">
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 italic">Haz clic en "Generar Lista de Compras" para agrupar los ingredientes del menú.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Nutritional Estimation Notice -->
                            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/60 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 space-y-2">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Estimación Nutricional (Aproximada)
                                </div>
                                <p>Las calorías y nutrientes son estimaciones generales para ayudarte a mantener energía y variedad. No establecemos restricciones estrictas.</p>
                                <div class="pt-2">
                                    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer font-medium">
